[2025-04-14 04:21:02,422][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "na-based-sms-phishing-triad-pivots-to-banks/feed/</wfw:commentRss>[\n]"
[2025-04-14 04:21:02,422][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9][0x9]<slash:comments>18</slash:comments>[\n]"
