[2025-04-14 04:21:02,509][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<title>Arrests in Tap-to-Pay Scheme Powered by Phishing</title>[\n]"
[2025-04-14 04:21:02,509][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<link>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2025/03/arrests-in-tap-to-pay-scheme-powered-by-phishing/</link>[\n]"
