[2025-04-14 04:21:02,587][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<title>DOGE to Fired CISA Staff: Email Us Your Personal Data</title>[\n]"
[2025-04-14 04:21:02,587][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<link>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2025/03/doge-to-fired-cisa-staff-email-us-your-personal-data/</link>[\n]"
