[2025-04-14 04:21:02,590][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<category><![CDATA[ClickFix]]></category>[\n]"
[2025-04-14 04:21:02,590][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-24 << "[0x9][0x9]<category><![CDATA[Facebook]]></category>[\n]"
